{"id":"n1-008","title":"A とも B とも (A tomo B tomo)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses two possibilities; 'either A or B', 'whether A or B'.","longExplanation":"The 'A とも B とも' grammar pattern indicates two possible scenarios. It can be translated as 'whether A or B' or 'either A or B'.","formation":"Noun + とも + Noun + とも (or sometimes Verb forms for each A, B)","examples":[{"jp":"決断とも誤りとも、結果は時間が教えてくれるでしょう。","romaji":"Ketsudan tomo ayamari tomo, kekka wa jikan ga oshiete kureru deshou.","en":"Whether it's a wise decision or a mistake, time will show the result.","words":[{"surface":"決断","vocabId":"1254370","reading":"けつだん"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誤り","vocabId":"1271290","reading":"あやまり"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"教え","vocabId":"1236890","reading":"おしえ","baseForm":"教える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"くれる","vocabId":"1514960","reading":"くれる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,3]},{"jp":"彼は父とも兄とも、もう何年も話していない。","romaji":"Kare wa chichi tomo ani tomo, mou nannen mo hanashite inai.","en":"He hasn't spoken to either his father or his brother in years.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"父","vocabId":"1497610","reading":"ちち"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"兄","vocabId":"1249900","reading":"あに"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もう","vocabId":"2081490","reading":"もう"},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"年","vocabId":"2084840","reading":"ねん"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話し","vocabId":"1562350","reading":"はなす","baseForm":"話す"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,5]},{"jp":"彼女とも友達とも映画を見に行くつもりです。","romaji":"Kanojo tomo tomodachi tomo eiga o mi ni iku tsumori desu.","en":"I plan to go watch a movie either with my girlfriend or a friend.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"つもり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"このゲームには時間とも努力とも言えないほどの根気が必要です。","romaji":"Kono geemu ni wa jikan tomo doryoku tomo ienai hodo no konki ga hitsuyou desu.","en":"This game requires a kind of persistence beyond just time or effort.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゲーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"努力","vocabId":"1445130","reading":"どりょく"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言え","vocabId":"1008860","reading":"いえる","baseForm":"言える"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ほど","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"根気","vocabId":"1290110","reading":"こんき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"必要","vocabId":"1487660","reading":"ひつよう"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,7,8]}]}